"In a disaster the System ignores personal teleport requests and assigns each person a priority timer."
"Timers vary from seconds to over an hour and may be adjusted; children go first."
"Rejecting the teleport is allowed but not advised, and no second slot is offered."
"The System does not follow Anesidora's own rescue priority numbers."
"Non-Avowed under twenty come first, then combat force preservation weighed against immediate risk."
"Parents are asked to consent to a child's teleport; contracted caretakers greet children on arrival."
"The Contract does not give non-Avowed a free salvation teleport."
"Mass teleports can drop hundreds at once in the Teleportation Complex concourse, icing its symbols."
